     "blockId": "p6-introduction-block",
     "replacement": "The equation of a hyperbola can be written $y=\\frac{k}{x-b}+c$, where $k$ is a non-zero integer and $x\\ne b$.\n\nThe **parameters** $k$, $b$ and $c$ each change the graph in a predictable way.",
     "autoApply": true,
     "key": "theory|p6-introduction-block",
     "targetFingerprint": "18198ee3de644742365080b79084411330df6e203024217be0b1d5ae3cac0e2a",
