    {
     "op": "theory",
     "blockId": "p7-sketching-instructions",
     "replacement": "To sketch a hyperbola $y=\\frac{k}{x-b}+c$:\n\n1. Find the $y$-intercept, if any, by letting $x=0$.\n2. Find the $x$-intercept, if any, by letting $y=0$.\n3. Draw the vertical asymptote $x=b$ and the horizontal asymptote $y=c$, then sketch the two branches through the intercepts.",
     "autoApply": true,
